<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: A simple automatic gun made to be mounted on a wardrone.-->
  <VFEPGun_MiniBlaster.description>一种简单的自动枪，安装在监护仪上。</VFEPGun_MiniBlaster.description>
  <!--EN: mini-blaster-->
  <VFEPGun_MiniBlaster.label>迷你爆能枪</VFEPGun_MiniBlaster.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEPGun_MiniBlaster.tools.0.label>桶</VFEPGun_MiniBlaster.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: drop pawn-->
  <VFEP_ActiveDropPawn.label>删除 pawn</VFEP_ActiveDropPawn.label>
  <!--EN: A variant of marine armor with an integrated grappling hook on the shoulder. The armor is slightly less protective than standard marine armor. The launcher does not require ammunition, but time needs to be reserved between shots to wind it up again.
Privateers usually specialize in getting in and out of dangerous situations easily. Grappling hook connects to walls and solid rock and allows the users to quickly move to the desired location.-->
  <VFEP_Apparel_Privateer.description>一种肩部带有集成抓钩的海洋装甲变体。该装甲的防护能力略低于标准海军陆战队装甲。发射器不需要弹药，但需要在射击之间预留时间以便再次上发条。
私兵通常擅长轻松进出危险情况。抓钩连接到墙壁和坚硬的岩石上，使用户能够快速移动到所需的位置。</VFEP_Apparel_Privateer.description>
  <!--EN: privateer armor-->
  <VFEP_Apparel_Privateer.label>私掠者装甲</VFEP_Apparel_Privateer.label>
  <!--EN: A large, bulky suit that allows the wearer to passively produce Rum once every 10 days. However, it is not very pleasant to wear as it feels like wearing damp, humid clothes from excessive sweating.\n\nThe suit includes a high-efficiency filter, heat-exchange filaments and salt precipitators. Urine and feces are processed in thigh pads and throughout the design are tubes that link to different catchpockets. Reprocessed bodily fluids are distilled into an alcoholic derivative of nutrient paste which can be drained when all the pockets are filled.\n\nRemoving the suit causes the accumulated liquid to evaporate, and it takes a long time to put on and properly adjust to the wearer. Due to the design, it can only be worn with an undersuit and the lack of head covering, while reducing efficiency, is purposefully done so it can be worn with head protection.-->
  <VFEP_Apparel_Rumsuit.description>一套大而笨重的套装，允许穿着者每 10 天被动生产一次朗姆酒。但穿着起来不太舒服，感觉就像穿着出汗过多而潮湿的衣服一样。

该套装包含高效过滤器、热交换丝和盐沉淀器。尿液和粪便在大腿垫中进行处理，整个设计中都有连接不同收集袋的管子。经过再处理的体液被蒸馏成营养膏的酒精衍生物，当所有口袋都装满后，就可以将其排出。

脱下防护服会导致积聚的液体蒸发，并且需要很长时间才能穿上并正确适应穿着者。由于设计原因，它只能与内衣一起穿着，并且没有头罩，同时降低了效率，因此可以与头部保护一起穿着。</VFEP_Apparel_Rumsuit.description>
  <!--EN: rumsuit-->
  <VFEP_Apparel_Rumsuit.label>朗姆装</VFEP_Apparel_Rumsuit.label>
  <!--EN: A manned gun that launches all kinds of shells. A variation of the mortar with all the benefits and drawbacks, however it has a 90 degree cone of direct-fire in exchange for having an effective firing rate that is twice as fast.-->
  <VFEP_Artillery_Cannon.description>发射各种炮弹的载人枪。迫击炮的变体，具有所有优点和缺点，但它具有 90 度锥形直射，以换取两倍的有效射速。</VFEP_Artillery_Cannon.description>
  <!--EN: cannon-->
  <VFEP_Artillery_Cannon.label>大炮</VFEP_Artillery_Cannon.label>
  <!--EN: A manned gun that launches all kinds of shells. A variation of the mortar with all the benefits and drawbacks, however it has a 90 degree cone of direct-fire in exchange for having an effective firing rate that is twice as fast.-->
  <VFEP_Artillery_FieldGun.description>发射各种炮弹的载人枪。迫击炮的变体，具有所有优点和缺点，但它具有 90 度锥形直射，以换取两倍的有效射速。</VFEP_Artillery_FieldGun.description>
  <!--EN: field gun-->
  <VFEP_Artillery_FieldGun.label>野战炮</VFEP_Artillery_FieldGun.label>
  <!--EN: A portable version of the Autocannon designed for use by a warcasket. Due to a shortened barrel it has a lower range, less penetration and damage compared to the turreted version. However, it is very capable in close quarters combat which makes up for the slight accuracy loss at greater ranges.-->
  <VFEP_Box_Autorifle.description>自动加农炮的便携式版本，专为战棺使用而设计。由于枪管较短，与炮塔版本相比，它的射程更短，穿透和伤害也更少。然而，它在近距离战斗中非常有能力，这弥补了在更远距离上的轻微精度损失。</VFEP_Box_Autorifle.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket autorifle-->
  <VFEP_Box_Autorifle.label>自动步枪战匣</VFEP_Box_Autorifle.label>
  <!--EN: A very unique melee weapon exclusively made for warcaskets. It combines massive weight and a cutting force that gives it no equal in melee combat. While it was intended for use against other warcaskets, it works just as well against smaller targets that would normally be considered armored.-->
  <VFEP_Box_Broadsword.description>专为战棺打造的非常独特的近战武器。它结合了巨大的重量和切割力，使其在近战战斗中无与伦比。虽然它的目的是用于对付其他战棺，但它也可以对付通常被认为是装甲的较小目标。</VFEP_Box_Broadsword.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket broadsword-->
  <VFEP_Box_Broadsword.label>战棺阔剑</VFEP_Box_Broadsword.label>
  <!--EN: Essentially an upscaled charge minigun designed to be used by a warcasket. While firing fewer projectiles in each burst, the ammunition has been improved with explosive payloads. Designed as a support weapon that completely invalidates cover for the unlucky bastards on the receiving end.-->
  <VFEP_Box_ChargeBlaster.description>本质上是一种升级版的冲锋机枪，设计用于战棺。虽然每次连射发射的射弹较少，但弹药的爆炸有效载荷有所改进。被设计成一种支援武器，让接收端的不幸混蛋的掩护完全失效。</VFEP_Box_ChargeBlaster.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket charge blaster-->
  <VFEP_Box_ChargeBlaster.label>战棺充能爆能器</VFEP_Box_ChargeBlaster.label>
  <!--EN: A terror on the battlefield, the charge lance received a massive upgrade for warcasket use. A considerably more powerful energy source gives it superior stopping power, able to fire multiple larger projectiles at a greater range with improved accuracy and penetration.-->
  <VFEP_Box_ChargeLance.description>冲锋枪是战场上的恐怖之物，经过大规模升级，可用于战棺。更强大的能源赋予它卓越的制动力，能够在更大的范围内发射多个更大的射弹，并提高精度和穿透。</VFEP_Box_ChargeLance.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket charge lance-->
  <VFEP_Box_ChargeLance.label>战棺冲锋枪</VFEP_Box_ChargeLance.label>
  <!--EN: An upscaled version of the combat knife designed for use by a warcasket. It is only still called a knife due to size comparison to a warcasket, but it is capable of cleaving a man in half and is just as large. The preferred weapon for the faster moving warcaskets that prioritize lightly armored, isolated targets.-->
  <VFEP_Box_CombatKnife.description>专为战棺使用而设计的战斗刀的升级版。由于与战棺相比，它仍然被称为刀，但它能够将人劈成两半，而且同样大。移动速度较快的战棺的首选武器，优先攻击轻装甲、孤立的目标。</VFEP_Box_CombatKnife.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket combat knife-->
  <VFEP_Box_CombatKnife.label>战棺战斗刀</VFEP_Box_CombatKnife.label>
  <!--EN: A monumental piece of anti-personnel technology that can only be properly utilized by the oversized warcaskets. Practically an engine block fitted to the end of a mech’s limb actuator, equipped with multiple pneumatic plates covering miniature repulsor generators designed for riot control. In layman’s terms, a strike from the head will launch the target backwards by several meters.-->
  <VFEP_Box_GravityHammer.description>这是一项具有里程碑意义的杀伤人员技术，只有超大的战棺才能正确使用。实际上是一个安装在机甲肢体执行器末端的发动机组，配备了多个气动板，覆盖着专为防暴设计的微型斥力发生器。通俗地说，从头部发起攻击，会将目标向后弹射数米。</VFEP_Box_GravityHammer.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket gravity hammer-->
  <VFEP_Box_GravityHammer.label>战棺重力锤</VFEP_Box_GravityHammer.label>
  <!--EN: An upscaled version of the grenade launcher designed for use by a warcasket. A straight upgrade, it fires in bursts of 3 and benefits from recoil damping for faster recovery and better range. Like all launchers though, it has a worse miss radius compared to a hand-thrown grenade.-->
  <VFEP_Box_GrenadeLauncher.description>榴弹发射器的升级版，专为战棺设计。直接升级后，它可连射 3 发，并受益于后坐力阻尼，可实现更快的恢复和更远的射程。但与所有发射器一样，与手榴弹相比，它的脱靶半径更差。</VFEP_Box_GrenadeLauncher.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket grenade launcher-->
  <VFEP_Box_GrenadeLauncher.label>战棺榴弹发射器</VFEP_Box_GrenadeLauncher.label>
  <!--EN: Essentially a handheld smoothbore mortar that fires explosives in an arc, able to bypass enemy fortifications. Made by those who wanted to combine ancient naval warfare with modern technology. The accuracy is abysmal but the onboard fabricator ensures that artillery fire can be provided without ever needing a resupply.-->
  <VFEP_Box_HandheldCannon.description>本质上是一种手持式滑膛迫击炮，可以沿弧线发射炸药，能够绕过敌人的防御工事。由那些想要将古代海战与现代技术结合起来的人制造。精度很差，但机载制造商确保无需补给即可提供炮火。</VFEP_Box_HandheldCannon.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket handheld cannon-->
  <VFEP_Box_HandheldCannon.label>战棺手持式大炮</VFEP_Box_HandheldCannon.label>
  <!--EN: An upscaled version of the heavy flamer designed for use by a warcasket. Thanks to the twin barrels and larger heat sink, it can spit out two jets of flames while also needing less time to prevent overheating.-->
  <VFEP_Box_HeavyFlamer.description>专为战棺使用而设计的重型火焰喷射器的升级版。得益于双枪管和更大的散热器，它可以喷出两股火焰，同时也需要更少的时间来防止过热。</VFEP_Box_HeavyFlamer.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket heavy flamer-->
  <VFEP_Box_HeavyFlamer.label>战棺重型火焰喷射器</VFEP_Box_HeavyFlamer.label>
  <!--EN: An upscaled version of the minigun designed for use by a warcasket. It uses larger caliber rounds which are poorly made en masse due to how many rounds need to be manufactured. Thus, it has a slower rate of fire and armor penetration, but who cares because no one wants to be on the receiving end of this amount of dakka.-->
  <VFEP_Box_Minigun.description>迷你枪的升级版，专为战棺使用而设计。它使用较大口径的子弹，由于需要制造多少发子弹，因此整体制造质量较差。因此，它的火力和装甲速度较慢穿透，但谁在乎呢，因为没有人愿意成为这么多达卡的接收端。</VFEP_Box_Minigun.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket minigun-->
  <VFEP_Box_Minigun.label>战棺机枪</VFEP_Box_Minigun.label>
  <!--EN: An upscaled version of the pump shotgun designed for use by a warcasket. Each cartridge fired contains 4 pellets larger than slugs from a regular-sized shotgun, giving it better range, armor penetration and much better damage. The recoil is insane though, even for a warcasket’s recoil damping system.-->
  <VFEP_Box_Slugthrower.description>泵动霰弹枪的升级版，专为战棺使用而设计。每个发射的弹药筒包含 4 个弹丸，比普通尺寸霰弹枪的弹头大，使其具有更好的射程、装甲 穿透 和更好的伤害。即使对于战棺的后坐阻尼系统来说，后坐力也是疯狂的。</VFEP_Box_Slugthrower.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket slugthrower-->
  <VFEP_Box_Slugthrower.label>战棺投弹者</VFEP_Box_Slugthrower.label>
  <!--EN: A portable version of the uranium slug cannon designed for use by a warcasket. Due to a shortened barrel it has less penetration, worse recoil and damage compared to the turreted version. However, it lacks the minimum range requirement thanks to a human operator and has better mid-range performance.-->
  <VFEP_Box_UraniumSlugRifle.description>铀弹头加农炮的便携式版本，设计用于战棺。由于枪管较短，与炮塔版本相比，它的穿透较少，后坐力和伤害更差。然而，由于需要人工操作，它缺乏最低范围要求，并且具有更好的中程性能。</VFEP_Box_UraniumSlugRifle.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket uranium slug rifle-->
  <VFEP_Box_UraniumSlugRifle.label>战棺铀子弹步枪</VFEP_Box_UraniumSlugRifle.label>
  <!--EN: cannonball-->
  <VFEP_Bullet_Cannonball.label>炮弹</VFEP_Bullet_Cannonball.label>
  <!--EN: gauntlet charge cannon bullet-->
  <VFEP_Bullet_GauntletChargeCanon.label>挑战冲锋大炮子弹</VFEP_Bullet_GauntletChargeCanon.label>
  <!--EN: grappling hook-->
  <VFEP_Bullet_GrapplingHook.label>抓钩</VFEP_Bullet_GrapplingHook.label>
  <!--EN: cannonball-->
  <VFEP_Bullet_HandheldCannonCannonball.label>炮弹</VFEP_Bullet_HandheldCannonCannonball.label>
  <!--EN: warcasket autorifle bullet-->
  <VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketAutorifle.label>战棺自动步枪子弹</VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketAutorifle.label>
  <!--EN: warcasket charge blaster shot-->
  <VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketChargeBlaster.label>战棺充能爆能枪射击</VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketChargeBlaster.label>
  <!--EN: warcasket charge lance shot-->
  <VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketChargeLance.label>战棺冲锋长枪射击</VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketChargeLance.label>
  <!--EN: warcasket minigun bullet-->
  <VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketMinigun.label>战棺机枪子弹</VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketMinigun.label>
  <!--EN: warcasket slugthrower blast-->
  <VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketSlugthrower.label>战棺弹头喷射器爆炸</VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketSlugthrower.label>
  <!--EN: uranium slug-->
  <VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketUraniumSlugRifle.label>铀块</VFEP_Bullet_WarcasketUraniumSlugRifle.label>
  <!--EN: A puddle of flammable chemfuel.-->
  <VFEP_Filth_Fuel.description>一滩易燃化学燃料。</VFEP_Filth_Fuel.description>
  <!--EN: chemfuel puddle-->
  <VFEP_Filth_Fuel.label>化学燃料水坑</VFEP_Filth_Fuel.label>
  <!--EN: Ship mounted anti-armor charge cannon, often utilised in ship-to-ship combat in low atmosphere.-->
  <VFEP_GauntletChargeCanon.description>舰载反装甲装药加农炮，通常用于低气压下的舰对舰战斗。</VFEP_GauntletChargeCanon.description>
  <!--EN: gauntlet charge cannon-->
  <VFEP_GauntletChargeCanon.label>挑战冲锋大炮</VFEP_GauntletChargeCanon.label>
  <!--EN: ship chunk battery (incoming)-->
  <VFEP_IShipChunkBattery.label>船用块电池（进货）</VFEP_IShipChunkBattery.label>
  <!--EN: ship chunk cryptosleep casket (incoming)-->
  <VFEP_IShipChunkCryptosleepCasket.label>运送大块加密睡眠棺材（传入）</VFEP_IShipChunkCryptosleepCasket.label>
  <!--EN: ship chunk debris (incoming)-->
  <VFEP_IShipChunkDebris.label>船体碎片（传入）</VFEP_IShipChunkDebris.label>
  <!--EN: ship chunk fuel tank (incoming)-->
  <VFEP_IShipChunkFuelTank.label>船用大块油箱（进货）</VFEP_IShipChunkFuelTank.label>
  <!--EN: ship chunk gauntlet turret (incoming)-->
  <VFEP_IShipChunkGauntletTurret.label>船用大块手套炮塔（传入）</VFEP_IShipChunkGauntletTurret.label>
  <!--EN: ship chunk Reactor (incoming)-->
  <VFEP_IShipChunkReactor.label>船块反应堆（传入）</VFEP_IShipChunkReactor.label>
  <!--EN: ship chunk volatile engine (incoming)-->
  <VFEP_IShipChunkVolatileEngine.label>船舶块易失性引擎（传入）</VFEP_IShipChunkVolatileEngine.label>
  <!--EN: ship chunk medical crate (incoming)-->
  <VFEP_IShipMedicalCrate.label>船用大块医疗箱（进货）</VFEP_IShipMedicalCrate.label>
  <!--EN: ship chunk nutrient paste crate (incoming)-->
  <VFEP_IShipNutrientPasteCrate.label>运送大块营养膏板条箱（进货）</VFEP_IShipNutrientPasteCrate.label>
  <!--EN: Semi-autonomous combat drone with onboard pathfinding capability. Equipped with a self-destruction module and tracking system, designed to be launched as a payload and then seek out enemy targets. If no nearby targets can be acquired, it will immediately detonate in order to prevent future accidents.-->
  <VFEP_Mech_Spidermine.description>具有机载寻路能力的半自主作战无人机。配备自毁模块和跟踪系统，设计为作为有效载荷发射，然后寻找敌方目标。如果无法捕获附近的目标，它会立即引爆，以防止将来发生事故。</VFEP_Mech_Spidermine.description>
  <!--EN: spidermine-->
  <VFEP_Mech_Spidermine.label>蜘蛛地雷</VFEP_Mech_Spidermine.label>
  <!--EN: frame-->
  <VFEP_Mech_Spidermine.tools.0.label>框架</VFEP_Mech_Spidermine.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: Semi-autonomous flying combat drone with limited combat functionality. Equipped with a lightweight semi-automatic miniturret due to limited recoil absorption and an onboard self-destruction module to both prevent enemy capture and defense against melee attackers.-->
  <VFEP_Mech_Wardrone.description>战斗功能有限的半自主飞行战斗无人机。由于后坐力吸收有限，配备了轻型半自动微型炮塔和机载自毁模块，既可以防止敌人捕获，又可以防御近战攻击者。</VFEP_Mech_Wardrone.description>
  <!--EN: wardrone-->
  <VFEP_Mech_Wardrone.label>沃德罗内</VFEP_Mech_Wardrone.label>
  <!--EN: turret-->
  <VFEP_Mech_Wardrone.tools.0.label>冲水</VFEP_Mech_Wardrone.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: frag grenade-->
  <VFEP_Proj_GrenadierGrenade.label>破片手榴弹</VFEP_Proj_GrenadierGrenade.label>
  <!--EN: A highly alcoholic beverage made from the recycled bodily fluids of those wearing rumsuits.\n\nAn ingenious way of not only improving morale but also allowing crew to operate longer without needing to resupply for food or dispose of human waste. Rum is very thick to drink - much like a protein shake - and the alcohol helps mask the otherwise unpleasant taste from repurposed nutrient paste dispenser technology.-->
  <VFEP_Rum.description>一种由穿着紧身衣的人回收的体液制成的高度酒精饮料。

这是一种巧妙的方法，不仅可以提高士气，还可以让机组人员工作更长时间，而无需补充食物或处理人类排泄物。朗姆酒喝起来很浓——很像蛋白质奶昔——而且酒精有助于掩盖重新利用的营养膏分配器技术带来的令人不快的味道。</VFEP_Rum.description>
  <!--EN: Drink {0}-->
  <VFEP_Rum.ingestible.ingestCommandString>喝{0}</VFEP_Rum.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
  <!--EN: Drinking {0}.-->
  <VFEP_Rum.ingestible.ingestReportString>饮酒 {0}。</VFEP_Rum.ingestible.ingestReportString>
  <!--EN: rum-->
  <VFEP_Rum.label>朗姆酒</VFEP_Rum.label>
  <!--EN: The mangled remains of ship-borne battery, used to power systems with high power draw for short periods. It was leaps and bounds about Rimworld battery technology but it can no longer be recharged and yields decent salvage once it’s stored charge has run out.-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkBattery.description>船载电池的残骸，用于为短时间内高功率消耗的系统供电。 Rimworld 的电池技术取得了突飞猛进的发展，但一旦存储的电量耗尽，它就无法再充电，并且可以产生不错的回收效果。</VFEP_ShipChunkBattery.description>
  <!--EN: ship chunk battery-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkBattery.label>船用块电池</VFEP_ShipChunkBattery.label>
  <!--EN: A self-powered cryptosleep casket caught in the remains of their ship’s hull. The occupant can still be recovered from the module, but most of the material is worth less than scrap metal and offers little salvage.-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkCryptosleepCasket.description>一个自供电的加密睡眠棺材捕获在他们的船体残骸中。乘员仍然可以从模块中回收，但大部分材料的价值低于废金属，并且几乎没有回收价值。</VFEP_ShipChunkCryptosleepCasket.description>
  <!--EN: ship chunk cryptosleep casket-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkCryptosleepCasket.label>运输大块加密睡眠棺材</VFEP_ShipChunkCryptosleepCasket.label>
  <!--EN: A chunk of a combat-grade spacecraft. It seems to have been torn off either by uncontrolled re-entry forces or some kind of weapon. It is densely packed with double-layer armor plating and control systems, which can be acquired by deconstructing it.-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkDebris.description>战斗级航天器的一大块。它似乎是被不受控制的重返大气层力量或某种武器撕断的。它密布着双层装甲和控制系统，可以通过解构获得。</VFEP_ShipChunkDebris.description>
  <!--EN: ship chunk debris-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkDebris.label>船舶大块碎片</VFEP_ShipChunkDebris.label>
  <!--EN: A tank of Chemfuel, punctured by the hull of its ship’s hull. Some of the fluid can be recovered while the majority is filled with grime, leaking out and creating a fire hazard. A prime target for any pyromaniac wanting to watch the world burn.-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkFuelTank.description>一罐化学燃料，被船体的船体刺穿。一些液体可以回收，而大部分液体充满污垢，泄漏并造成火灾危险。对于任何想要观看世界燃烧的纵火狂来说，这是一个主要目标。</VFEP_ShipChunkFuelTank.description>
  <!--EN: ship chunk fuel tank-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkFuelTank.label>船用大块油箱</VFEP_ShipChunkFuelTank.label>
  <!--EN: The remains of the housing for the Gauntlet charge cannon. Powered externally, the ammunition storage is wrecked and cannot be replaced. Once the turret empties its magazine, it is still valuable salvage worth recovery.-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkGauntletTurret.description>用于放置 Gauntlet 装药的外壳的剩余部分 大炮。由于采用外部供电，弹药库已损坏且无法更换。一旦炮塔清空弹匣，它仍然是值得回收的宝贵资源。</VFEP_ShipChunkGauntletTurret.description>
  <!--EN: ship chunk gauntlet turret-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkGauntletTurret.label>船舶大块手套炮塔</VFEP_ShipChunkGauntletTurret.label>
  <!--EN: The remains of a combat-grade spacecraft’s nuclear reactor, low-yield and designed to operate alongside energy storage. Surprisingly, the reactor is fully functional with no structural damage, so it can be safely used for ground operations.-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkReactor.description>战斗级航天器核反应堆的残骸，产量低，设计用于与能量存储一起运行。令人惊讶的是，反应堆功能齐全，没有结构损坏，因此可以安全地用于地面操作。</VFEP_ShipChunkReactor.description>
  <!--EN: ship chunk reactor-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkReactor.label>船用块状反应堆</VFEP_ShipChunkReactor.label>
  <!--EN: Self-powered turbo engines for a combat-grade spacecraft, designed for atmospheric use. The control and safety system are damaged and the turbines are unable to take in enough air to cool itself. If not properly dismantled, the accumulating energy will tear itself apart.-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkVolatileEngine.description>用于战斗级航天器的自供电涡轮发动机，专为大气使用而设计。控制和安全系统损坏，涡轮机无法吸入足够的空气来冷却自身。如果拆除不当，积聚的能量就会自行撕裂。</VFEP_ShipChunkVolatileEngine.description>
  <!--EN: ship chunk volatile engine-->
  <VFEP_ShipChunkVolatileEngine.label>船舶块易失性引擎</VFEP_ShipChunkVolatileEngine.label>
  <!--EN: A now-unsealed crate containing first-aid supplies. The pallet can be dismantled for steel along with recovering the supplies.-->
  <VFEP_ShipMedicalCrate.description>一个现已启封的板条箱，里面装有急救用品。托盘可以拆除以获取钢材并回收物资。</VFEP_ShipMedicalCrate.description>
  <!--EN: ship medical crate-->
  <VFEP_ShipMedicalCrate.label>船舶医疗箱</VFEP_ShipMedicalCrate.label>
  <!--EN: A now-unsealed crate containing emergency food rations. The pallet can be dismantled for steel along with recovering the supplies.-->
  <VFEP_ShipNutrientPasteCrate.description>一个现已启封的板条箱，里面装有紧急口粮。托盘可以拆除以获取钢材并回收物资。</VFEP_ShipNutrientPasteCrate.description>
  <!--EN: ship nutrient paste crate-->
  <VFEP_ShipNutrientPasteCrate.label>船用营养膏箱</VFEP_ShipNutrientPasteCrate.label>
  <!--EN: drop pod (incoming)-->
  <VFEP_SideDropPod.label>空投舱（传入）</VFEP_SideDropPod.label>
  <!--EN: A portable medieval cannon mounted on a 180 degree swivel that launches roughly-rounded balls of steel at a considerable range. The accuracy is rather lacking, but it is a vast improvement compared to catapults while also having a considerably faster fire rate.-->
  <VFEP_Turret_Cannon.description>一种便携式中世纪 大炮，安装在 180 度旋转装置上，可在相当远的范围内发射大致圆形的钢球。精度相当低，但与弹射器相比是一个巨大的进步，同时射速也相当快。</VFEP_Turret_Cannon.description>
  <!--EN: cannon-->
  <VFEP_Turret_Cannon.label>大炮</VFEP_Turret_Cannon.label>
  <!--EN: A manned gun that launches all kinds of shells. A variation of the mortar with all the benefits and drawbacks, however it has a 90 degree cone of direct-fire in exchange for having an effective firing rate that is twice as fast.-->
  <VFEP_Turret_FieldGun.description>发射各种炮弹的载人枪。迫击炮的变体，具有所有优点和缺点，但它具有 90 度锥形直射，以换取两倍的有效射速。</VFEP_Turret_FieldGun.description>
  <!--EN: field gun-->
  <VFEP_Turret_FieldGun.label>野战炮</VFEP_Turret_FieldGun.label>
  <!--EN: A complex foundry with four operating arms designed to assist an operator in mounting a person into the frame of a warcasket. Once they are locked in, the pilot cannot leave until the procedure is finished.\n\nTo begin, an operator starts linking them to the suit - their nerves and limbs permanently linked to the frame. Since the warcasket is not designed to register wear or damage they will feel no pain. The pilot can exit the foundry only when the final rivet is placed, the last plate is welded, and the power system is brought online. Until then they will need external help such as feeding as they are effectively buried alive.\n\nBecause the various parts of the warcasket are welded onto the frame as a single, homogenous entity,  one can mix and match various designs to suit the situation but certain later generations of warcaskets function better if they are part of the same series.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketFoundry.description>一个复杂的铸造厂，有四个操作臂，旨在帮助操作员将人安装到战棺框架中。一旦它们被锁定，飞行员就无法离开，直到程序完成。

首先，操作员开始将它们连接到宇航服上 - 他们的神经和四肢永久连接到框架上。由于战棺的设计不是为了记录磨损或损坏，因此他们不会感到疼痛。只有当最后一个铆钉被放置、最后一块板被焊接并且电力系统上线时，飞行员才能离开铸造厂。在此之前，它们将需要外部帮助，例如喂食，因为它们实际上是被活埋的。

由于战棺的各个部分作为一个单一的同质实体焊接到框架上，因此可以混合搭配各种设计以适应情况，但某些后续版本的战棺如果属于同一系列，则功能会更好。</VFEP_WarcasketFoundry.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket foundry-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketFoundry.label>战棺铸造厂</VFEP_WarcasketFoundry.label>
  <!--EN: A portable version of the autocannon designed for use by a warcasket. Due to a shortened barrel it has a lower range, less penetration and damage compared to the turreted version. However, it is very capable in close quarters combat which makes up for the slight accuracy loss at greater ranges.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Autorifle.description>便携式版本的自动加农炮设计用于战棺。由于枪管较短，与炮塔版本相比，它的射程更短，穿透和伤害也更少。然而，它在近距离战斗中非常有能力，这弥补了在更远距离上的轻微精度损失。</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Autorifle.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket autorifle-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Autorifle.label>自动步枪战匣</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Autorifle.label>
  <!--EN: stock-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Autorifle.tools.0.label>库存</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Autorifle.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Autorifle.tools.1.label>桶</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Autorifle.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: Essentially an upscaled charge minigun designed to be used by a warcasket. While firing fewer projectiles in each burst, the ammunition has been improved with explosive payloads. Designed as a support weapon that completely invalidates cover for the unlucky bastards on the receiving end.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeBlaster.description>本质上是一种升级版的冲锋机枪，设计用于战棺。虽然每次连射发射的射弹较少，但弹药的爆炸有效载荷有所改进。被设计成一种支援武器，让接收端的不幸混蛋的掩护完全失效。</VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeBlaster.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket charge blaster-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeBlaster.label>战棺充能爆能器</VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeBlaster.label>
  <!--EN: stock-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeBlaster.tools.0.label>库存</VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeBlaster.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeBlaster.tools.1.label>桶</VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeBlaster.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: A terror on the battlefield, the charge lance received a massive upgrade for warcasket use. A considerably more powerful energy source gives it superior stopping power, able to fire multiple larger projectiles at a greater range with improved accuracy and penetration.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeLance.description>冲锋枪是战场上的恐怖之物，经过大规模升级，可用于战棺。更强大的能源赋予它卓越的制动力，能够在更大的范围内发射多个更大的射弹，并提高精度和穿透。</VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeLance.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket charge lance-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeLance.label>战棺冲锋枪</VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeLance.label>
  <!--EN: stock-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeLance.tools.0.label>库存</VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeLance.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeLance.tools.1.label>桶</VFEP_WarcasketGun_ChargeLance.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: An upscaled version of the grenade launcher designed for use by a warcasket. A straight upgrade, it fires in bursts of 3 and benefits from recoil damping for faster recovery and better range. Like all launchers though, it has a worse miss radius compared to a hand-thrown grenade.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_GrenadeLauncher.description>榴弹发射器的升级版，专为战棺设计。直接升级后，它可连射 3 发，并受益于后坐力阻尼，可实现更快的恢复和更远的射程。但与所有发射器一样，与手榴弹相比，它的脱靶半径更差。</VFEP_WarcasketGun_GrenadeLauncher.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket grenade launcher-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_GrenadeLauncher.label>战棺榴弹发射器</VFEP_WarcasketGun_GrenadeLauncher.label>
  <!--EN: stock-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_GrenadeLauncher.tools.0.label>库存</VFEP_WarcasketGun_GrenadeLauncher.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_GrenadeLauncher.tools.1.label>桶</VFEP_WarcasketGun_GrenadeLauncher.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: Essentially a handheld smoothbore mortar that fires explosives in an arc, able to bypass enemy fortifications. Made by those who wanted to combine ancient naval warfare with modern technology. The accuracy is abysmal but the onboard fabricator ensures that artillery fire can be provided without ever needing a resupply.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_HandheldCannon.description>本质上是一种手持式滑膛迫击炮，可以沿弧线发射炸药，能够绕过敌人的防御工事。由那些想要将古代海战与现代技术结合起来的人制造。精度很差，但机载制造商确保无需补给即可提供炮火。</VFEP_WarcasketGun_HandheldCannon.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket handheld cannon-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_HandheldCannon.label>战棺手持式大炮</VFEP_WarcasketGun_HandheldCannon.label>
  <!--EN: stock-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_HandheldCannon.tools.0.label>库存</VFEP_WarcasketGun_HandheldCannon.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_HandheldCannon.tools.1.label>桶</VFEP_WarcasketGun_HandheldCannon.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: An upscaled version of the heavy flamer designed for use by a warcasket. Thanks to the twin barrels and larger heat sink, it can spit out two jets of flames while also needing less time to prevent overheating.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_HeavyFlamer.description>专为战棺使用而设计的重型火焰喷射器的升级版。得益于双枪管和更大的散热器，它可以喷出两股火焰，同时也需要更少的时间来防止过热。</VFEP_WarcasketGun_HeavyFlamer.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket heavy flamer-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_HeavyFlamer.label>战棺重型火焰喷射器</VFEP_WarcasketGun_HeavyFlamer.label>
  <!--EN: stock-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_HeavyFlamer.tools.0.label>库存</VFEP_WarcasketGun_HeavyFlamer.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_HeavyFlamer.tools.1.label>桶</VFEP_WarcasketGun_HeavyFlamer.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: An upscaled version of the minigun designed for use by a warcasket. It uses larger caliber rounds which are poorly made en masse due to how many rounds need to be manufactured. Thus, it has a slower rate of fire and armor penetration, but who cares because no one wants to be on the receiving end of this amount of dakka.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Minigun.description>迷你枪的升级版，专为战棺使用而设计。它使用较大口径的子弹，由于需要制造多少发子弹，因此整体制造质量较差。因此，它的火力和装甲速度较慢穿透，但谁在乎呢，因为没有人愿意成为这么多达卡的接收端。</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Minigun.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket minigun-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Minigun.label>战棺机枪</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Minigun.label>
  <!--EN: stock-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Minigun.tools.0.label>库存</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Minigun.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Minigun.tools.1.label>桶</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Minigun.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: An upscaled version of the pump shotgun designed for use by a warcasket. Each cartridge fired contains 4 pellets larger than slugs from a regular-sized shotgun, giving it better range, armor penetration and much better damage. The recoil is insane though, even for a warcasket’s recoil damping system.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Slugthrower.description>泵动霰弹枪的升级版，专为战棺使用而设计。每个发射的弹药筒包含 4 个弹丸，比普通尺寸霰弹枪的弹头大，使其具有更好的射程、装甲 穿透 和更好的伤害。即使对于战棺的后坐阻尼系统来说，后坐力也是疯狂的。</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Slugthrower.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket slugthrower-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Slugthrower.label>战棺投弹者</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Slugthrower.label>
  <!--EN: stock-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Slugthrower.tools.0.label>库存</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Slugthrower.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_Slugthrower.tools.1.label>桶</VFEP_WarcasketGun_Slugthrower.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: A portable version of the uranium slug cannon designed for use by a warcasket. Due to a shortened barrel it has less penetration, worse recoil and damage compared to the turreted version. However, it lacks the minimum range requirement thanks to a human operator and has better mid-range performance.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_UraniumSlugRifle.description>铀弹头加农炮的便携式版本，设计用于战棺。由于枪管较短，与炮塔版本相比，它的穿透较少，后坐力和伤害更差。然而，由于需要人工操作，它缺乏最低范围要求，并且具有更好的中程性能。</VFEP_WarcasketGun_UraniumSlugRifle.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket uranium slug rifle-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_UraniumSlugRifle.label>战棺铀子弹步枪</VFEP_WarcasketGun_UraniumSlugRifle.label>
  <!--EN: stock-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_UraniumSlugRifle.tools.0.label>库存</VFEP_WarcasketGun_UraniumSlugRifle.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketGun_UraniumSlugRifle.tools.1.label>桶</VFEP_WarcasketGun_UraniumSlugRifle.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: A very unique melee weapon exclusively made for warcaskets. It combines massive weight and a cutting force that gives it no equal in melee combat. While it was intended for use against other warcaskets, it works just as well against smaller targets that would normally be considered armored.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_Broadsword.description>专为战棺打造的非常独特的近战武器。它结合了巨大的重量和切割力，使其在近战战斗中无与伦比。虽然它的目的是用于对付其他战棺，但它也可以对付通常被认为是装甲的较小目标。</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_Broadsword.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket broadsword-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_Broadsword.label>战棺阔剑</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_Broadsword.label>
  <!--EN: point-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_Broadsword.tools.0.label>观点</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_Broadsword.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: blade-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_Broadsword.tools.1.label>刀刃</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_Broadsword.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: An upscaled version of the combat knife designed for use by a warcasket. It is only still called a knife due to size comparison to a warcasket, but it is capable of cleaving a man in half and is just as large. The preferred weapon for the faster moving warcaskets that prioritize lightly armored, isolated targets.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_CombatKnife.description>专为战棺使用而设计的战斗刀的升级版。由于与战棺相比，它仍然被称为刀，但它能够将人劈成两半，而且同样大。移动速度较快的战棺的首选武器，优先攻击轻装甲、孤立的目标。</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_CombatKnife.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket combat knife-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_CombatKnife.label>战棺战斗刀</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_CombatKnife.label>
  <!--EN: point-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_CombatKnife.tools.0.label>观点</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_CombatKnife.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: blade-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_CombatKnife.tools.1.label>刀刃</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_CombatKnife.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: A monumental piece of anti-personnel technology that can only be properly utilized by the oversized warcaskets. Practically an engine block fitted to the end of a mech’s limb actuator, equipped with multiple pneumatic plates covering miniature repulsor generators designed for riot control. In layman’s terms, a strike from the head will launch the target backwards by several meters.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_GravityHammer.description>这是一项具有里程碑意义的杀伤人员技术，只有超大的战棺才能正确使用。实际上是一个安装在机甲肢体执行器末端的发动机组，配备了多个气动板，覆盖着专为防暴设计的微型斥力发生器。通俗地说，从头部发起攻击，会将目标向后弹射数米。</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_GravityHammer.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket gravity hammer-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_GravityHammer.label>战棺重力锤</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_GravityHammer.label>
  <!--EN: head-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_GravityHammer.tools.0.label>头</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_GravityHammer.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: handle-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_GravityHammer.tools.1.label>处理</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_GravityHammer.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: A military modification of the Plasmasaw, adapted for use by warcaskets for anti-materiel purposes. The original intention for this bastard sword was for it to be able to extend like a whip while also having a simple straight form, however issues with containing the plasma shelved the idea. Instead, the links are used to change the length of the sword as well as allow easier replacement of damaged sections.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_PlasmaSword.description>等离子锯的军事改良版，适合用于反物资用途的战箱。这把混蛋剑的初衷是让它能够像鞭子一样延伸，同时还具有简单的笔直形状，但是由于包含等离子体的问题而搁置了这个想法。相反，这些连杆用于改变剑的长度，并可以更轻松地更换损坏的部分。</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_PlasmaSword.description>
  <!--EN: warcasket plasma sword-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_PlasmaSword.label>战棺等离子剑</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_PlasmaSword.label>
  <!--EN: point-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_PlasmaSword.tools.0.label>观点</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_PlasmaSword.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: blade-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_PlasmaSword.tools.1.label>刀刃</VFEP_WarcasketMeleeWeapon_PlasmaSword.tools.1.label>
</LanguageData>
